      "translations": {
        "en": "Abu al-Hasan (peace be upon him) said: 'When I looked at my body, I saw that I could not increase or decrease its breadth or length, nor could I repel hardships from it or draw benefits to it. I knew that this structure has a Builder, so I acknowledged Him. Along with what I see of the orbiting of the celestial sphere by His power, the creation of clouds, the directing of winds, the movement of the sun, moon, and stars, and other wonderful, perfectly crafted signs, I knew that this has a Determiner and an Originator.'"
